## Versions
@solana/web3.js v1.98.4, Anchor v0.32.1

## Core Principles
Use PublicKey from @solana/web3.js v1.98.4, never cast directly (validate through PublicKey constructor), use PublicKey.isOnCurve(), use @repo/utils/web3 for chain utilities

## Address Handling
new PublicKey(address) in try/catch, PublicKey.isOnCurve(publicKey) for validation

## Transaction Handling
Create transaction: new Transaction().add(SystemProgram.transfer({ fromPubkey, toPubkey, lamports }))

## Performance
Reuse PublicKey instances, validate addresses early

## Anchor Setup
Install: pnpm setup:solana (auto Anchor v0.32.1) or manual (Homebrew/avm), location: contracts/solana/ (@repo/contracts-solana), build skips gracefully without Anchor, Linux: Rust/Cargo required first

## Contract Development
Anchor v0.32.1 framework, test tokens use PDA-based mint authority (faucet)

